  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 2056(b)(7), a QTIP election allows the executor to claim a full marital deduction for trust property that provides all income to the surviving spouse for life. This defers estate tax until the surviving spouse''s death, when the trust is included in her estate under Section 2044.
