Wrong (A): The trust is not excluded from the estate. It is included in Ferrante''s gross estate but offset by the marital deduction, resulting in zero net tax at his death.
Wrong (C): The QTIP election specifically overrides the terminable interest rule that would otherwise disqualify the trust from the marital deduction.
