UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 170(b)(1)(A)(i), churches are automatically classified as public charities regardless of their funding sources. The one-third support test does not apply to churches, schools, or hospitals. This reflects Congress''s recognition that churches serve inherently public purposes.
Wrong (A): Religious contributions are not weighted differently. The one-third support test simply does not apply to churches at all, making the weighting question irrelevant.
