-- Q8013: Tax-Exempt Organizations [easy/L2]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 6033, organizations with gross receipts normally $50,000 or less may file Form 990-N (e-Postcard), a simple electronic notice containing the organization''s name, address, EIN, and confirmation of continued eligibility. With $38,000 in gross receipts, Neighborhood Watch Coalition qualifies.
